@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080
# Generate with: go run ./cmd/token
@token = replace-me

### List articles (requires article:read; P0 returns an empty page)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/v1/articles?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without a token should return 401
GET {{host}}/api/admin/v1/articles
